hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1760","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai: Allah Taala farmaata hai: Main ne apne nek bandon key liye tayyaar kya hai jo aankh ne nahi dekha aur na kaan ne suna aur na bashar key dil par guzra, zakheera, uskey siwa jo tum par zaahir kya gaya hai. Phir Aap ne padha: (To koi jaan nahi jaanti jo unkey liye aankhon ki thandak mein chhupaaya gaya hai, badla jo wo kartey they). (Bukhari: 4780). Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apni biwiyon ko ikhtiyaar deney ka hukm diya gaya to Aap ne mujh se shuru kya aur farmaya: Beshak main tumhey muamla yaad dilaata hun, to tum par nahi hai ke tum jaldi na karo yahan tak ke tum apne maan baap se mashwara karo. Unhon-ne kaha: Jabke wo jaan chukey they ke merey maan baap mujhey us se judai ka hukm na dengey. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir farmaya: Beshak Allah ne farmaya: (Ae Nabi! Apni biwiyon se kaho: Agar tum duniya ki zindagi aur uski zeenat chaahten) (badey ajr) tak. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne kaha: To is mein main apne maan baap se mashwara kyun karun! Beshak main Allah aur uskey Rasool aur aakhirat key ghar ko chaahten hun. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwiyon ne waisa kya jaisa main ne kya. (4786). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Allah Taala ka qaul: (Tum un mein se jise chaaaho peechey karo aur jise chaaaho apne paas rakkho) aayat."
